<title>ANGOLA: SOCCER-ANGOLA BEAT TOGO 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ANGOLA BEAT TOGO 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Angola beat Togo 3-1 (halftime 2-1) in their World Cup Africa group four qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Angola - Paulao 30, Akwa 45 pen, Sousa 55</p>
<p>Togo - Sheeba 21</p>
<p>Attendance: 25,000</p>
</text>
